      "writtenOn": "2023-04-25T03:58:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It wouldn\u0027t hurt to point at the actual example of https://github.com/archlinuxarm/PKGBUILDs/blob/master/core/linux-aarch64/PKGBUILD#L191 (despite it not using hooks) instead of a hypothetical.",
      "range": {
