      },
      "lineNbr": 75,
      "author": {
        "id": 1113904
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-25T03:58:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These days this is no enough on a lot of boards as there\u0027s per board stuff (like on brya to tell the EC to fiddle with some voltage rails). We\u0027re essentially forcing everyone to use futility or the previous incantation of \"cros flash\" (which had even more annoying dependencies like chromite).\n\nCould we link to something more official instead? I don\u0027t want to oversimplify this to the point where it doesn\u0027t work a lot of the time.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 75,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 75,
        "endChar": 54
      },
      "revId": "587ce7db42228f9b3cc5ca647ceb248e598c62e0",
