      "message": "I do like this documented, but i do have a little bit of a nit on the application of it: what is the purpose of this document beyond Intel uses?\n\nSure, if I have an Intel device, I might want to do the UEFI route to boot normal PC distros. But at that point I\u0027m not getting much beyond what mrchromebox offers beyond warm fuzzies that it\u0027s built by myself.\n\nBut if it\u0027s ARM, what custom bootloaders are really available? You\u0027re far better off just repackaging your kernel as paragraph starting at line 24 says.",
